00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.560
you're ready, and how that could be

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.960
helpful not only in how it's been

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.480
helpful for you, but how it could be for

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.920
other people.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.800
It's it's a sense of urgency. In my

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.720
book, I talk about like the traits that

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.480
you have to have to be successful in any

