move. Let's go. Let's find a way to get

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.160
that first customer. Let's find the

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.920
thing that needs to be done and do it.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.080
Let's think think at the whole business,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.880
think about the big picture, and think

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.840
about, "Hey, what's the lowest-hanging

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:47.440
fruit that we can go and attack and make

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.920
our business better today, right now?"

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.000
And how can I do it by lunch?

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.160
Um

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
so, that's

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:56.120
If you have that mindset, you can be

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.680
phenomenally powerful. What happens is

